  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHO Middle East Response - Lebanon 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUMMARY: This project is funded by the Dutch National Appeal, popularly known as Giro555 but run by the Stichting Samenwerkende Hulp Organisaties (Foundation Collaborating Aid Organisations), referred to as the SHO, who thus acts as the donor for this project. The SHO is itself made up of 11 of the country&#x2019;s largest humanitarian organizations.
SHO launched a national appeal in The Netherlands that aims to respond to the acute crisis in the Middle East, after the rapid escalation of violent conflict in the area. Lebanon is one of the countries affected by the hostilities, that resulted in massive displacement, and a severe need for basic life-saving assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
